m/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123590","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123590.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123590.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAdds a secondary color for the non-numeric part of SpinBox format text, similar to EditorSpinSlider's label and suffix colors.\r\n\r\n[Nagranie ekranu_20260918_001337.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d83dcbbd-b694-45a4-a987-c2e501839603)\r\n\r\n[Nagranie ekranu_20260917_233623.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fab646b9-5dee-4399-b7b6-6dbdbcfa3b10)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSince SpinBox uses internal LineEdit, I had to duplicate the LineEdit's text drawing code and also modify String's `sprintf()` to extract the formatted part of the string. The changes are rather invasive, but not sure if there is a better solution.\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123590/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123590/time